 2. Other happenings 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Photo: Mario Tama/Getty Images

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 🛍️ Macy's delivered 2.7% comparable sales growth as it focused its turnaround efforts on core stores, but the stock fell after its outlook disappointed investors. ( Bloomberg )

 💵 Polymarket hired its first CFO, veteran finance executive Warren Jenson. He joins the prediction market as it scrambles to catch up to its arch rival Kalshi. ( Reuters )

 📊 OpenAI launched a version of ChatGPT built for the financial services industry through a design partnership with Morgan Stanley and Evercore, designed to research companies, analyze financial data and generate presentations. ( CNBC )

 
 
